#
# A linelist with some important cooling lines for various species in AIOLOS.
# Entries are:
#    Speciesname,                      Has to match its species counterpart in the *spc-file, otherwise the line cannot be mapped to species
#    wavelength,                       Numerical values of the wavelength
#    wavelength unit,                  Allowed values: angstroem, micron, mm, nm
#    A' [erg/s],                       The "effective A" = A * hnu * gu/gl
#    Line excitation temperature[K],   
#    Critical electron density [cm-3]: The ratio of de-excitation coefficients A_21/C_21
#
# The order of lines doesn't matter, as long as the species index matches an existing species in the simulation, the line will be assigned to its cooling function.
#
